[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752945\">5510C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752556\">1092B40</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the crankshaft services\npulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046272.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752945\">5510C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752556\">1092B40</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the crankshaft services\npulley (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046272.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752641\">1092G11</a></p><p>1. Fit a pin (8 mm diameter) through the hole on the gearbox, to\nbe used for countertorque.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064619.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3>