g class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the crankshaft pulley (1a) in place and secure it tightening\nthe bolts (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankshaft flange side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064621.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Remove the pin from the hole on the gearbox.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752641\">1092G11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]